      "text": "E[#BearingWearHigh = b] = sum over all rows and all other causes\n                              Q_i(BearingWearHigh = b, ...)\n\nP(BearingWearHigh = b) = E[#BearingWearHigh = b] / (number of rows)\n\n\nE[#HighVibration = s, BearingWearHigh = b] =\n        sum over all rows with symptom value s\n        and over all other causes Q_i(BearingWearHigh = b, ...)\n\nP(HighVibration = s | BearingWearHigh = b) =\n        E[#HighVibration = s, BearingWearHigh = b] /\n        E[#BearingWearHigh = b]\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "E[#BearingWearHigh = b] = sum over all rows and all other causes\n                              Q_i(BearingWearHigh = b, ...)\n\nP(BearingWearHigh = b) = E[#BearingWearHigh = b] / (number of rows)\n\n\nE[#HighVibration = s, BearingWearHigh = b] =\n        sum over all rows with symptom value s\n        and over all other causes Q_i(BearingWearHigh = b, ...)\n\nP(HighVibration = s | BearingWearHigh = b) =\n        E[#HighVibration = s, BearingWearHigh = b] /\n        E[#BearingWearHigh = b]\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
